+# Third-party notices
+
+## Termux terminal-view and terminal-emulator
+
+CybX Mobile 0.4.0 uses the published `com.termux.termux-app:terminal-view:0.118.0` library, which brings in the matching `terminal-emulator` module. These two terminal libraries are licensed under Apache License 2.0 according to the Termux project maintainers and upstream repository notices.
+
+- Upstream: https://github.com/termux/termux-app
+- Termux Libraries integration guide: https://github.com/termux/termux-app/wiki/Termux-Libraries
+- License notice: https://github.com/termux/termux-app/blob/master/LICENSE.md
+
+The Termux application's main app and other modules have separate license terms; CybX depends on only the terminal-view and terminal-emulator libraries. Review the upstream version's license notices before redistributing a modified copy.
